{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-b2f486", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「結論を捨てました」という断片と、捨てずに流す祓いの手順を対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d5baee", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-cd144b", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-b2f486", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「要約は腐らない」という断片に、灰を混ぜた水の変換を重ねる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-dd4370", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-aa85d2", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-09fb0e", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "ごみ箱の不在から、行き先を書かない伝票へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-122b0a", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-7e3d10", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-022", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "屑籠の所作から、汚水槽の蓋へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-4f5cce", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-7e3d10", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-83e251", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "捨てない方針から、流す手順の覚え書きへ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-88cbdd", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-b2f486", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-cd144b", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "捨てた結論と、残留だけを流す祓いを対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-b96b1d", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-b2f486", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-105242", "type": "material"}, "note": "土が死人を引き受ける歌に、万物が流れる変身譚を響かせる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ce9706", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-367", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-12d78d", "type": "material"}, "note": "塵山の富と、クルックの自然発火を対照する。同じディケンズだが、廃棄物の扱いが違う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-bd1bee", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-701c52", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-a601f6", "type": "material"}, "note": "汚穢屋への憧れに、厠の薄暗さをめぐる随筆を響かせる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-9e7f3c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-403", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d61c85", "type": "material"}, "note": "「汚穢と禁忌」の分類論に、分類から外れた屎尿の法制史で応じる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-b7ada0", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-f3cc13", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-43d979", "type": "material"}, "note": "異質なものの力に、水俣の記録の声を響かせる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-881f72", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-193", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-319b47", "type": "material"}, "note": "排泄と看取りが同じ帳面にある一茶の日記に、衛生統計の身体を重ねる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ddea52", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c44855", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-abject", "type": "material"}, "note": "火の監査（借り物の火）を、排出の監査（行き先のない排出）で再測定する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-4cc9a1", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-fire", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-abject", "type": "material"}, "note": "値札のない帳簿と、商品だった下肥を対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-5019d4", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-currency", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-abject", "type": "material"}, "note": "代替可能な役割枠の監査と、汚物の使い道の関数を対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-27cb21", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-eros", "type": "material"}}
